 "premise": "Akira Tachibana, a high school runner who quit track after a leg injury, falls for Masami Kondo, the 45-year-old manager of the family restaurant where she works part-time. Kondo treats her confession as passing admiration and keeps his distance while facing his own abandoned dream of writing novels. The two help each other move forward: she returns to running and he finishes his manuscript.",
 "life_message": "After a setback, the way forward is to return to the passions you gave up, rather than hiding in a feeling that cannot be.",
